<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Borg-Warner Auto started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Borg-Warner Auto started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Phil Fricke confirmed he initated coverage of Borg-Warner Automotive Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said company has the engineering expertise and management culture to adapt to rapid changes in engine transmission and transfer case design and changes in air and fuel systems procurement.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target $54.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 earnings $4.50 a share, compared to $3.26 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1998 earnings $4.90 a share.</p>
</text>
